WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:02.535
-Guys,
the pandemic is spiking,

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:04.871
so it's still very important to
wear a mask when you go outside,

00:00:04.871 --> 00:00:07.407
but there are a lot of guys
out there who don't wear masks

00:00:07.407 --> 00:00:10.109
because they think
it makes them look weak.

00:00:10.109 --> 00:00:11.644
Well, I saw a commercial
for a store

00:00:11.644 --> 00:00:13.012
that can help those guys out,

00:00:13.012 --> 00:00:15.748
and they're actually having
a special Halloween sale.

00:00:15.748 --> 00:00:18.151
Check this out.

00:00:18.151 --> 00:00:21.054
-Are you a big veiny meat man
who wants to look tough

00:00:21.054 --> 00:00:23.189
while wearing
your COVID safety mask

00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:24.757
and you also like Halloween?!

00:00:24.757 --> 00:00:28.527
Well, muchacho, your prayers
have been answered, hombre!

00:00:28.527 --> 00:00:31.898
Hi! I'm Lee Durango,
owner of Masculine Man Masks,

00:00:31.898 --> 00:00:34.000
the number-one store
that sells masks

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:38.237
with badass designs
for tough and often scary men!

00:00:38.237 --> 00:00:40.473
You know Halloween used
to be the only time of year

00:00:40.473 --> 00:00:42.341
you could whip out
a badass mask,

00:00:42.341 --> 00:00:44.510
but now we have
to wear a mask every day!

00:00:44.510 --> 00:00:46.212
That doesn't mean
you can't make yours scary

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:47.846
and messed the heck up!

00:00:47.846 --> 00:00:49.882
I have masks like Dracula

00:00:49.882 --> 00:00:52.451
drinking a peanut butter
protein shake!

00:00:52.451 --> 00:00:55.154
A Jack-o'-lantern
with a Tapout logo!

00:00:55.154 --> 00:00:57.856
Frankenstein getting
his crossfit gym membership

00:00:57.856 --> 00:01:00.126
revoked because
he got too yoked!

00:01:00.126 --> 00:01:03.363
And a bunch of bugs
and bug guts are on your mouth

00:01:03.363 --> 00:01:07.800
because you're, like, some
bug-eating villain or something!

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:09.836
Not sure if that's
a Halloween thing or not,

00:01:09.836 --> 00:01:12.071
but I have 500
of those mother [bleep]

00:01:12.071 --> 00:01:13.205
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.205 --> 00:01:15.107
But what if you're
a really Jacked-up guy

00:01:15.107 --> 00:01:16.575
who's extra twisted,

00:01:16.575 --> 00:01:19.078
and you don't want
just any old scary mask?!

00:01:19.078 --> 00:01:21.948
You want one that, when mommies
see you walking down the street,

00:01:21.948 --> 00:01:24.983 line:0%
they cover their sonnies'
and daughties' eyes?!

00:01:24.983 --> 00:01:26.486 line:0%
Well, brother, I got you!

00:01:26.486 --> 00:01:28.955 line:0%
'Cause I'll show you
the scariest masks on Earth!

00:01:28.955 --> 00:01:31.591 line:0%
But make sure no children
or puppies are watching,

00:01:31.591 --> 00:01:34.494 line:0%
'cause these masks will give
them permanent nightmares!

00:01:34.494 --> 00:01:38.498
We have a guy's mouth that has
Chucky hiding inside of it!

00:01:38.498 --> 00:01:41.267
A werewolf who has a bunch
of food stuck in his teeth!

00:01:41.267 --> 00:01:43.302
And the scariest mask of all,

00:01:43.302 --> 00:01:45.471
your wife asking you,
"What are you thinking about?"

00:01:45.471 --> 00:01:47.006
[ Woman screams ]

00:01:47.006 --> 00:01:49.074
So, come on down to
Masculine Man Masks,

00:01:49.074 --> 00:01:51.343
the only way to make
your mouth as badass

00:01:51.343 --> 00:01:54.747
as my Papa Roach cover band,
Uncle Head Lice!

00:01:54.747 --> 00:01:56.816
-Masculine Man Masks
Halloween sale is located

00:01:56.816 --> 00:01:58.550
next to the steroid-injected
pumpkin patch

00:01:58.550 --> 00:02:00.319
and the haunted ATV dealership.

00:02:00.319 --> 00:02:01.387
[ Cheers and applause ]

